    "Show current / maximum HP as text on the health bars of bosses, adventurers and dark enemies.": "在首领、冒险家和黑暗敌人的体力条上以文字显示当前/最大体力。",
    "Add your real damage (with your current stats) to the descriptions of skulls, skills, swaps, items, essences and inscriptions.": "在小骨、技能、替换、道具、精华和刻印的说明中加入你的实际伤害（按当前属性）。",
    "Pickup preview": "拾取预估",
    "Items on the ground, in shops and in the swap menu show their numbers as if you had picked them up (their stats and inscription steps included).": "地上、商店和替换菜单中的道具显示拾取后的数值（包括其属性和刻印阶段）。",
    "Open / close key": "打开/关闭键",
    "The key that opens and closes the combat log.": "打开和关闭战斗记录的按键。",
    "Dialogue frame": "对话框背景",
    "Use the NPC dialogue box artwork as the window background (off: a plain dark panel).": "用NPC对话框的美术作为窗口背景（关闭：纯色暗面板）。",
    "Background": "背景",
    "How solid the dialogue background is (0% invisible, 100% solid).": "对话框背景的不透明度（0%透明，100%不透明）。",
    "Calculations": "计算记录",
    "Record how every hit's number came about (stats, items, inscriptions, dark abilities, crits, debuffs); hover a log line to see it.": "记录每次攻击数值的来由（属性、道具、刻印、黑暗技能、暴击、减益）；将鼠标悬停在记录行上即可查看。",
    "Save to file": "保存到文件",
    "Also write every hit (with its calculation) to BepInEx/DamageInsight/CombatLogs, one file per game session (the newest 30 are kept).": "同时把每次攻击（含计算）写入 BepInEx/DamageInsight/CombatLogs，每次游戏一个文件（保留最新30个）。",
    "Show mini log": "显示迷你记录",
    "Show a few log lines above the minimap. Can also be switched in the combat log window.": "在小地图上方显示几行记录。也可以在战斗记录窗口中切换。",
    "Lines": "行数",
    "How many lines the mini log shows.": "迷你记录显示的行数。",
    "Hide after": "隐藏延时",
    "Hide the mini log when no new damage came in for this long.": "在这段时间内没有新伤害时隐藏迷你记录。",
    "Pie chart": "饼图",
    "Show a tiny pie chart at the right of the mini log.": "在迷你记录右边显示一个小饼图。",
    "Gap above map": "与地图的间距",
    "Distance between the minimap and the mini log (in pixels at 1920x1080).": "小地图与迷你记录之间的距离（以1920x1080下的像素计）。",
    "Show seconds": "显示秒数",
    "Show the remaining seconds on the skill, swap, quintessence, item and ability icons (83s, 2m+, 10m). Cooldown speed bonuses are included.": "在技能、替换、精华、道具和能力图标上显示剩余秒数（83秒、2分+、10分）。已计入冷却速度加成。",
    "Opacity": "不透明度",
    "How strongly the seconds are drawn.": "秒数显示的浓淡程度。",
    "Record progress": "记录进度",
    "Record your progress for the Codex (enemies met and killed, gear found) and capture enemy pictures.": "为图鉴记录你的进度（遇到和击杀的敌人、找到的装备）并拍下敌人的图像。",
    "The key that opens and closes the Codex book.": "打开和关闭图鉴的按键。",
    "Move hints": "招式提示",
    "Under a boss move in the Codex: when the boss uses it (HP range, distance, cooldown...), read from its AI. Shown once you have beaten the boss.": "在图鉴的首领招式下方显示首领何时使用（体力区间、距离、冷却…），从其AI中读取。击败首领后显示。",
    "Film boss attacks": "录制首领攻击",
    "Film each boss attack once (a small picture 10 times a second, effects included) to show it in the Codex.": "每个首领攻击录制一次（每秒10张小图，含特效），在图鉴中展示。",
    "Window position": "窗口位置",
    "Puts the combat log window back to its default place and size (you can drag it and pull its corners; it remembers where you left it).": "把战斗记录窗口恢复到默认位置和大小（可以拖动窗口、拉动四角调整大小；它会记住你放置的位置）。",
    "All settings": "全部设置",
    "Reset everything": "全部重置",
    "Puts every setting on this page back to its default. Your Codex progress stays as it is.": "把本页的所有设置恢复为默认值。你的图鉴进度保持不变。",
    "Takes effect in the Codex at once.": "立即在图鉴中生效。",
